-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일반인도 별도의 신청절차 없이 대회 참관 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자세한 내용은 한국은행 경제교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(www.bokeducation.or.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">문 의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국은행 커뮤니케이션국 뉴미디어팀</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0